text:
"Streaming now, $PlayerSirOrMadam, specs indicate we should be able to see the recall order once the failsafe is triggered." The control signal is spartan, an endless stream of abbreviations and data saving measures. Each minute the same lines appear. 

//EUT-202SNW-RADTHRSHLD: 0.05% 
//EUT-202SNW-SYSCHECK: ACTIVE

Within the hour the second shuttle is away, then the third, then the fourth and the fifth, the radiation threshold ticking up more with each predicted impact. You watch the rear shuttle camera feed skimming above the thin clouds of $name like a bird of prey, main bays open to trail lines of transplutonics like the spittle of an anticipatory predator.

//EUT-202SNW-RADTHRSHLD: 110% 
//EUT-202SNW-SYSCHECK: EMERGENCY RECALL
